WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.603
-Yesterday, Eminem released
a freestyle rap video.

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:05.705
Did anybody see that?

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.707
Did anybody see --
[ Audience cheers ]

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.943
In which he took on a number of
political and social issues

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:12.745
and ended the video

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:16.749
by calling on any of his fans
who still support Donald Trump

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:18.585
to decide
between Trump and himself.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:20.185
Take a look.

00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:24.157
-[ Rapping ] ♪ And any fan of
mine who's a supporter of his ♪

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:26.759
♪ I'm drawing in the sand
a line ♪

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.195
♪ You're either for or against ♪

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.998
♪ And if you can't decide
who you like more ♪

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:35.468
♪ And you're split
on who you should stand beside ♪

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.970
♪ I'll do it for you with this ♪

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:40.006
♪ ...you ♪

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.207
-Powerful stuff.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.675
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.177
Powerful stuff.

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:47.880
And I was inspired by that,

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.583
so tonight, I say
to any fans of this show

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.420
who are also big fans
of Donald Trump,

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.257
it's time to make a decision,
guys.

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:01.060
Get off the fence.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.096
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:05.965
Do you support him,

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.033
or do you support this show

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.269
that constantly mocks

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:11.370
and denigrates
everything about him?

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.539
I know it's a tough call,

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.507
but the time has come
to make a decision.

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:16.109
Now, I'm not much of a rapper...

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.276
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:18.745
...but here it goes.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:23.216
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:26.586
[ Rapping ] ♪ My name is Seth,
and I'm here to say ♪

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.321
♪ If you like Trump,
then go away ♪

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.323
[ Cheers and applause ]

